  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a mystical realm with the custom Dragon Quilt Set by Jeminise. This soft, breathable bedding set features a mythical dragon fantasy design that is perfect for kids, boys, girls, teens, and animal lovers alike. Designed to bring comfort and unique style to any room decor, it serves as an inviting addition for napping, reading, or lounging.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Supports custom name or text input to create a truly unique bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from a breathable microfiber and cotton-polyester blend for all-seasons comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Complete bedding set options include a quilt bedspread and matching pillow shams.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in versatile sizes including Twin, Full, Queen, King, and Throw dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Conveniently machine washable for hassle-free maintenance and long-lasting durability.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber, Cotton-Polyester Blend</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragon Quilt D2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Dragon, Holidays</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Queen, Twin, Full, King, Throw</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
